{"id":"58e742656f0db590","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-savitch.md","title":"thm-savitch (Savitch Theorem)","display":"thm-savitch (Savitch Theorem)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-nspace]]","[[28-df-dspace]]","[[28-df-space-constructible]]","[[28-df-configuration-graph]]"],"display":"thm-savitch (Savitch Theorem)","label":"28-thm-savitch","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-savitch","Savitch Theorem","Savitch's Theorem"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"54da139362531e67\" href=\"?note=54da139362531e67\" title=\"28-df-nspace\">28-df-nspace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4382c6bdd7033833\" href=\"?note=4382c6bdd7033833\" title=\"28-df-dspace\">28-df-dspace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"af1247ecca733ff0\" href=\"?note=af1247ecca733ff0\" title=\"28-df-space-constructible\">28-df-space-constructible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1b4d0bd43db4c9c9\" href=\"?note=1b4d0bd43db4c9c9\" title=\"28-df-configuration-graph\">28-df-configuration-graph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-savitch (Savitch Theorem)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-savitch"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-savitch</span><span>Savitch Theorem</span><span>Savitch's Theorem</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 为空间可构造函数，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\">\\(s(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NSPACE}\">\\(\\mathrm{NSPACE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DSPACE}\">\\(\\mathrm{DSPACE}\\)</span> 采用本目录工作带空间和常数因子约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)\\subseteq\\mathrm{DSPACE}(n\\mapsto s(n)^2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)\\subseteq\\mathrm{DSPACE}(n\\mapsto s(n)^2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>输入固定后，合法空间受限配置可用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(s(n))\">\\(O(s(n))\\)</span> 比特编码，共至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{O(s(n))}\">\\(2^{O(s(n))}\\)</span> 个。递归检验 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 是否有长至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^i\">\\(2^i\\)</span> 的路：基例允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=v\">\\(u=v\\)</span> 或一步边；递归枚举中点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>，依次检验两半路径。每层存常数个配置和枚举计数器，深度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(s(n))\">\\(O(s(n))\\)</span>，故总空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(s(n)^2)\">\\(O(s(n)^2)\\)</span>；两次递归可重用空间。包含同一顶点的零步路径是基例必要分支。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理4.14及证明；印刷86页；PDF112页。递归与空间分析已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-nspace","status":"resolved","id":"54da139362531e67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-dspace","status":"resolved","id":"4382c6bdd7033833","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-dspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-space-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"af1247ecca733ff0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-space-constructible]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-graph","status":"resolved","id":"1b4d0bd43db4c9c9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration-graph]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"s(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)\\subseteq\\mathrm{DSPACE}(n\\mapsto s(n)^2).","display":true},{"tex":"O(s(n))","display":false},{"tex":"2^{O(s(n))}","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"2^i","display":false},{"tex":"u=v","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"O(s(n))","display":false},{"tex":"O(s(n)^2)","display":false}],"bytes":1254,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"层次结论：[[28-thm-time-hierarchy]]、[[28-thm-space-hierarchy]]、[[28-thm-p-neq-exp]]、[[28-thm-savitch]]、[[28-thm-npspace-equals-pspace]]、[[28-thm-immersman-szelepcsényi]]。"},{"id":"dc66c114284dcdc1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["54da139362531e67","4382c6bdd7033833","af1247ecca733ff0","1b4d0bd43db4c9c9"]}